[00:09.90]I've been sleeping on the couch
[00:09.90]我在沙发上辗转反侧
[00:13.53]If you wanna call it sleep
[00:13.53]若这也算睡眠的话
[00:16.03]Every square inch of this house
[00:16.03]这房子里的每一寸空间
[00:18.52]Is messy as you left me
[00:18.52]都像你离开时那样凌乱不堪
[00:20.85]Between the sour mash and the barley
[00:20.85]躺在酸麦芽与大麦酒之间
[00:23.32]And all the bottles in the trash
[00:23.32]还有垃圾桶里的瓶瓶罐罐
[00:25.80]You'd think I'm a living party
[00:25.80]你或许以为 我正活在狂欢里
[00:28.27]But girl, you're the life of that
[00:28.27]但女孩 你才是那狂欢的灵魂
[00:31.22]Turns out I needed you
[00:31.22]原来我曾如此需要你
[00:34.09]And the leaving you
[00:34.09]而离开你
[00:36.80]Wasn't half as smart as I thought it was
[00:36.80]远不如我以为的那般明智
[00:40.94]'Cause my life's in pieces now
[00:40.94]如今我的生活支离破碎
[00:44.09]And I'm seeing how
[00:44.09]我终于明白
